[I] KDE Oxygen style

[T] Oxygen is a classic style for KDE Plasma and was the default style of
[T] KDE 4; it is now offered as an optional package. It contains color
[T] schemes, cursors, the Air and Oxygen desktop themes, a window decoration
[T] and the Qt widget style.

[U] https://www.kde.org

[A] The KDE-Team
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

